#: ../../tutorial/06_fsm.rst:99
msgid "Handlers fire **in registration order**, so the ``/cancel`` escape hatch must be registered **before** the state-bound handlers — otherwise a state handler (e.g. ``NewNote.title``) may consume the message first. A catch-all handler with no filters must always stay registered last."
msgstr ""

